I just got a call from Yoshito.

260
00:20:12,790 --> 00:20:15,860
He said he wanted to
see the movie too, so...

261
00:20:15,860 --> 00:20:21,700
Being with two guys...
isn't very good for Maho's future.

262
00:20:28,210 --> 00:20:30,710
Yoshito-kun, you want
to look at the program?

263
00:20:30,710 --> 00:20:34,380
I never read it before a movie.

264
00:20:34,380 --> 00:20:35,750
Oh...

265
00:20:40,150 --> 00:20:44,990
On the stage, they are perfect.
They're flawless.

266
00:20:44,990 --> 00:20:50,830
Yes they are...And maybe not,
depending on your point of view.

267
00:20:50,830 --> 00:20:54,000
Ahem. Excuse me...

268
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:57,500
Everybody has a life, a daily life.

269
00:20:57,500 --> 00:21:00,340
There's no exception; they do.

270
00:21:00,340 --> 00:21:02,510
Conflict with their agent?

271
00:21:02,510 --> 00:21:05,380
It's none of our business!

272
00:21:08,350 --> 00:21:13,010
Of course, Eddy. These guys
are the next big thing in Japan.

273
00:21:14,520 --> 00:21:19,530
If we like them at the rehearsal,
yeah, we could play with them.

274
00:21:19,530 --> 00:21:23,760
Belle Ame...It means
"beautiful spirit" in French.

275
00:21:25,200 --> 00:21:27,390
Bugger off. Hit the road.

276
00:21:29,100 --> 00:21:31,370
-Jim, give me that!
-After all, Eddy is just a guy.

277
00:21:31,370 --> 00:21:32,640
-Hey! They're waiting for us.
-After all, Eddy is just a guy.

278
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:35,710
-Why are you saying this now? Shit!
-But, that makes Dying Breed appealing.

279
00:21:35,710 --> 00:21:40,810
-What shall we do? That's irresponsible.
Hey Jim! What are you filming!?
-On top of that, Matt is wild.

280
00:21:42,220 --> 00:21:46,720
Like a river flowing,
inspiration always flows from my mind.

281
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:50,890
-Hey! Dancing, dancing...Party man...
-Oh! He's a funny guy.

282
00:21:50,890 --> 00:21:55,830
-Happy birthday to you...
-Happy birthday to you...
-Happy birthday to you...

283
00:21:59,070 --> 00:22:03,570
Sometimes, there comes a special day,
while they're on tour.

284
00:22:03,570 --> 00:22:05,540
It's a beautiful scene.

285
00:22:06,570 --> 00:22:10,740
Tokyo...a city of noise
and chaos. Techno-city.

286
00:22:10,740 --> 00:22:11,580
Come on!

287
00:22:11,580 --> 00:22:14,250
They had a live here, as well.

288
00:22:14,250 --> 00:22:16,410
In the evening, with the shining moon...

289
00:22:18,090 --> 00:22:21,540
They met a boy. It was
a very special event.

290
00:22:38,370 --> 00:22:40,530
I felt like something great...

291
00:22:41,540 --> 00:22:42,940
...was about to happen.

292
00:22:50,580 --> 00:22:52,680
Another minute

293
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:55,380
Feelin' so fine

294
00:22:57,690 --> 00:22:59,920
You turn the freeze

295
00:22:59,920 --> 00:23:02,650
into warm light

296
00:23:04,760 --> 00:23:08,230
Had a premonition

297
00:23:08,230 --> 00:23:10,900
I've been waitin' ever since

298
00:23:10,900 --> 00:23:14,400
My world comin' down

299
00:23:14,400 --> 00:23:17,200
It's got me spinnin' 'round

300
00:23:18,980 --> 00:23:25,150
If you really wanna fly

301
00:23:25,150 --> 00:23:27,910
you gotta let go

302
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:42,500
Simply the most

303
00:23:42,500 --> 00:23:44,530
big sensation

304
00:23:44,530 --> 00:23:47,340
(once you're here you won't go back)

305
00:23:47,340 --> 00:23:49,610
She's really pretty

306
00:23:49,610 --> 00:23:51,610
One-eyed vision

307
00:23:51,610 --> 00:23:54,440
(lose the fear it don't come back)

308
00:23:54,440 --> 00:23:57,950
Little sister showed me

309
00:23:57,950 --> 00:24:00,620
Really took me for a ride

310
00:24:00,620 --> 00:24:02,280
My world comin' down

311
00:24:02,280 --> 00:24:05,620
(once you're here you won't go back)

312
00:24:05,620 --> 00:24:09,650
(lose the fear it don't come back)

313
00:24:13,760 --> 00:24:16,330
That Sato lady was funny, wasn't she?

314
00:24:16,330 --> 00:24:20,200
"Live 20
'Grateful Sound'”

315
00:24:16,330 --> 00:24:20,200
Next episode: Grateful Sound!
Will Beck be able to perform?
